<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Friday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	 9.95 / 9.80   10.125/10.00    10.675/10.50</p>
<p>BPI			 9.90 / 9.70   10.375/10.10    10.85 /10.60</p>
<p>Citibank		  9.70 / 9.60   10.125/10.00    10.70 /10.50</p>
<p>Multinational	   9.90 / 9.78   10.20 /10.10    10.575/10.525</p>
<p>PCIBank		  10.10 / 9.90   10.50 /10.25    11.25 /10.85</p>
<p>Solidbank		 9.97 / 9.87   10.30 /10.20    10.85 /10.75</p>
<p>StandChart Bank	 9.80 / 9.70   10.35 /10.25    10.75 /10.65</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8937</p>
